aign-builder/templates/disaster-relief/photo-1.jpg\";s:16:\"width_percentage\";s:3:\"100\";s:5:\"align\";s:4:\"left\";s:9:\"css_class\";s:0:\"\";}i:5;a:6:{s:8:\"headline\";s:5:\"Share\";s:15:\"social_networks\";a:7:{s:7:\"twitter\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"facebook\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"linkedin\";s:1:\"1\";s:9:\"pinterest\";s:1:\"1\";s:8:\"mastodon\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"threads\";s:1:\"1\";s:7:\"bluesky\";s:1:\"1\";}s:12:\"open_new_tab\";s:1:\"1\";s:16:\"width_percentage\";s:3:\"100\";s:5:\"align\";s:4:\"left\";s:9:\"css_class\";s:0:\"\";}i:2;a:5:{s:8:\"headline\";s:12:\"Donate Today\";s:7:\"content\";s:513:\"<p>Hey there! We\'re in urgent need of support for the Central Tilba School of Arts Halls, as we face a $65,000 shortfall to complete necessary repairs and ensure these cherished community spaces remain safe and accessible. Your contribution, no matter the amount, will have a meaningful impact on preserving our local heritage for future generations. Please consider donating!</p><p>You can make tax deduction donations to the SHASA Public Fund and SHASA will transfer these funds to the Tilba Halls Committee</p>\";s:16:\"width_percentage\";s:3:\"100\";s:5:\"align\";s:4:\"left\";s:9:\"css_class\";s:0:\"\";}i:11;a:5:{s:8:\"headline\";s:13:\"Bank Details \";s:7:\"content\";s:49:\"<p>BSB: 641 800</p><p>Bank Account: 200924351</p>\";s:16:\"width_percentage\";s:3:\"100\";s:5:\"align\";s:4:\"left\";s:9:\"css_class\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"tabs\";a:1:{i:0;a:2:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Overview\";s:11:\"visible_nav\";s:9:\"invisible\";}}s:8:\"settings\";a:2:{s:7:\"general\";a:7:{s:11:\"description\";s:281:\"<p>The two historic Tilba halls are being lovingly restored to preserve their heritage and transform them into safe, accessible, and vibrant community spaces. Your donation supports essential upgrades and ensures these cherished buildings continue to serve generations to come.</p>\";s:20:\"extended_description\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"goal\";d:65000;s:8:\"end_date\";i:0;s:19:\"campaign_creator_id\";s:1:\