 northern Australia</h1><span class=\"ArticleHeadlineTitleByline_byline__L2QD7\"><span class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP Byline_byline__1LJC2 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile24__crkfh Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_letterSpacedNone__rZ0yQ\" data-component=\"Byline\"><span class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_letterSpacedSm__V8kil\" data-component=\"Text\"><div><span>By <a class=\"Link_link__5eL5m ScreenReaderOnly_srLinkHint__OysWz Link_showVisited__C1Fea Link_showFocus__ALyv2\" href=\"/news/charlie-mclean/102041290\" data-component=\"ContentLink\" data-uri=\"coremedia://person/102041290\">Charlie McLean</a> and <a class=\"Link_link__5eL5m ScreenReaderOnly_srLinkHint__OysWz Link_showVisited__C1Fea Link_showFocus__ALyv2\" href=\"/news/kimberley-putland/105433266\" data-component=\"ContentLink\" data-uri=\"coremedia://person/105433266\">Kimberley Putland</a></span></div></span></span></span><ul class=\"CardTagList_tags__dheC7 scrollbar_scrollbarThemed__kGZnS\"><li><span class=\"Tag_container__7_5W6 CardTag_container__uoMZ7\"><a data-component=\"InfoSourceTag\" href=\"https://www.abc.net.au/pilbara/\" class=\"Tag_link__PE2t9 Tag_tag__TMEI2 CardTag_tag__2hWFV ArticleHeadlineTitle_tag__E9UOl CardTag_pill__w_eEQ\"><p class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP CardTag_text__99Z73 Typography_typography__clrwy Typography_bold__FqafP Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\" style=\"--mobileFontSize:0.875rem;--mobileLineHeight:1.25;--laptopSmFontSize:0.875rem\">ABC Pilbara</p></a></span></li><li><span class=\"Tag_container__7_5W6 CardTag_container__uoMZ7\"><a data-component=\"SubjectTag\" href=\"/news/topic/climate-change\" class=\"Tag_link__PE2t9 Tag_tag__TMEI2 CardTag_tag__2hWFV ArticleHeadlineTitle_tag__E9UOl CardTag_pill__w_eEQ\"><p class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP CardTag_text__99Z73 Typography_typography__clrwy Typography_bold__FqafP Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\" style=\"--mobileFontSize:0.875rem;--mobileLineHeight:1.25;--laptopSmFontSize:0.875rem\"><span class=\"ScreenReaderOnly_srOnly__bnJwm\" data-component=\"ScreenReaderOnly\">Topic:</span>Climate Change</p></a></span></li></ul><div class=\"ArticleHeadlineTitle_meta__eYg46\"><time class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP ArticleHeadlineTitle_metaTimestamp__Ri6e7 DynamicTimestamp_displayDate__Y3t35 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_letterSpacedSm__V8kil\" data-component=\"Timestamp\" aria-hidden=\"true\" dateTime=\"2025-10-22T19:59:56.000Z\"><span>Wed 22 Oct</span></time><time class=\"ScreenReaderOnly_srOnly__bnJwm\" data-component=\"ScreenReaderOnly\" dateTime=\"2025-10-22T19:59:56.000Z\">Wednesday 22 October</time><time class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP ArticleHeadlineTitle_metaTimestamp__Ri6e7 DynamicTimestamp_printDate__OVPa2 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_letterSpacedSm__V8kil\" data-component=\"Text\"><span>Wed 22 Oct 2025 at 7:59pm</span></time></div></div></div><div class=\"\"><figure class=\"ContentAlignment_marginBottom__4H_6E ContentAlignment_overflowAuto__c1_IL Figure_figure__xLyBy Figure_docImage__DSvk4\" data-print=\"inline-media\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"105881158\" data-uri=\"coremedia://imageproxy/105881158\"><div class=\"Figure_content__8xRH4\"><div class=\"FigureContent_content__GnImC\"><div class=\"ContentImage_ratio__0yYeG\"><div class=\"AspectRatio_container__FC_XH\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:1.7777777777777777\" data-component=\"AspectRatioContainer\"><img alt=\"Various images of two men partipacting in a local parkrun in Karratha, WA.\" class=\"Image_image__5tFYM ContentImage_image__DQ_cq\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"https://live-production.wcms.abc-cdn.net.au/ecddd1397f0aa740d8b23837e22cc3c1?impolicy=wcms_crop_resize&amp;cropH=4473&amp;cropW=7952&amp;xPos=0&amp;yPos=416&amp;width=862&amp;height=485\" loading=\"lazy\" data-component=\"Image\" data-lazy=\"true\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"Figure_caption__fS2lN\"><p class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP FigureCaption_text__zDxQ5 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\">Climate change is testing the endurance of residents in Western Australia&#x27;s north-west.<!-- --> <cite>(<span>ABC News: Kimberley Putland</span>)</cite></p></figcaption></div></figure></div></div><div class=\"ArticleSummary_summary__8mUeC Article_head__Z9JYB\"><div class=\"Article_main___guM5\"><h2 class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP Heading_heading__VGa5B heading_heading__C7MQP Typography_sizeMobile20__NUDn4 Typography_sizeDesktop32__LR_G6 Typography_lineHeightMobile24__crkfh Typography_lineHeightDesktop40__BuoRf Typography_marginBottomMobileSmall__6wx7m Typography_marginBottomDesktopSmall__CboX4 Typography_black__9qnZ1 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_normalise__u5o1s\" data-component=\"Heading\">In short:</h2><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__Z5Ozx\">Some urban areas in northern Australia are struggling to adapt to climate change as experts warn of increasingly unbearable temperatures.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__Z5Ozx\">Water scarcity in the sub-tropics and extreme weather in the tropics is making climate mitigation more difficult.</p><h2 class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP Heading_heading__VGa5B heading_heading__C7MQP Typography_sizeMobile20__NUDn4 Typography_sizeDesktop32__LR_G6 Typography_lineHeightMobile24__crkfh Typography_lineHeightDesktop40__BuoRf Typography_marginBottomMobileSmall__6wx7m Typography_marginBottomDesktopSmall__CboX4 Typography_black__9qnZ1 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_normalise__u5o1s\" data-component=\"Heading\">What&#x27;s next?</h2><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__Z5Ozx\">An urban design expert says significant temperature reductions can be achieved by building low-cost shade structures and using cool reflective building materials.</p></div></div></div><aside class=\"Article_layout__fHMrs Article_hidePrint__pUZjb\"><div data-component=\"ShareBanner\" class=\"ShareBanner_container__OX63I Article_main___guM5\"><div data-component=\"AddressShareBar\" class=\"ShareBanner_addressShareBar__gSRSJ AddressShareBar_addressShareBar__yv8K2\"><div id=\"pageURL\" aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-label=\"https://www.abc.net.au/news/2025-10-23/northern-australia-struggles-to-adapt-to-climate-change/105841310\" class=\"AddressShareBar_address__D3ZaM AddressShareBar_showButton__r3mTa\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"-1\"><div class=\"AddressShareBar_link__o15ZQ\">abc.net.au/news/northern-australia-struggles-to-adapt-to-climate-change/105841310</div></div><button class=\"Button_btn___qFSk AddressShareBar_button__m_1Rm Button_filled__Z0XIL Button_hasIcon__G3VLB Button_hasText__gfeBI Button_iconLeft__6d9H_\" aria-label=\"Copy link\" data-component=\"Button\" aria-describedby=\"pageURL\" role=\"button\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" data-component=\"Link\" class=\"icon_icon__9kCSO AddressShareBar_icon__c2Qju icon_size24__GkyQ9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M11.119 14.069s-.48-.33-.694-.544c-1.367-1.367-1.404-3.546-.082-4.868l2.992-2.992c1.321-1.321 3.5-1.285 4.868.082 1.367 1.367 1.403 3.546.081 4.868l-1.555 1.556\"></path><path stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12.559 10.153c.247.149.48.33.694.544 1.367 1.367 1.403 3.546.082 4.868l-2.992 2.992c-1.322 1.321-3.501 1.285-4.868-.082-1.367-1.367-1.404-3.547-.082-4.868L6.95 12.05\"></path></svg><span></span></button><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"AddressShareBar_indicator___px0_\">Link copied</span></div><div class=\"ShareBanner_actionButtons__gL_n0\"><button role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Share this article\" type=\"button\" class=\"Button_root__UZ8td Button_large__OX1mV Button_withIcon__Znha0 Button_withGap__va3j2 Button_contextSurface___wmqq ShareBanner_shareButton__Ngjqb\"><span class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP Typography_sizeMobile14__u7TGe Typography_sizeDesktop16__zyLf4 Typography_lineHeightDesktop16__eRkjh Typography_bold__FqafP Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\"><span class=\"ShareBanner_buttonTextShort__0jad7\">Share</span><span class=\"ShareBanner_buttonTextLong__CQFkk\">Share <!-- -->article</span></span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\" height=\"1em\" data-component=\"ShareWeb\" class=\"icon_icon__9kCSO icon_size24__GkyQ9\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M15 13s-9-1-12.998 7c0 0 0-13 12.998-13V3l7 7-7 7v-4Z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg></button></div></div></aside><div class=\"Article_layout__fHMrs\"><div class=\"ArticleWeb_article__n_kQQ Article_main___guM5 Article_hasSidebars__QaE5b\"><div class=\"ArticleRender_article__7i2EW\"><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Talk to anyone who has lived north of Australia&#x27;s 26th parallel and it will not be long until the conversation turns to the heat.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Karratha residents at an early October park run in WA&#x27;s north west were jogging in 30-degree heat by 8am.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">At the height of summer, the heat will be much worse. The Pilbara city hit 48.4C in 2022.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Some, like new-arrivals Sam Scott and Charlie Gilbert, have started making adjustments.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;This guy [Charlie] actually had to shave his head because he wasn&#x27;t dealing with the heat,&quot; Mr Scott said.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">But there is only so much climate adaptation individuals can do.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;Look around, there&#x27;s no trees or shade anywhere, so you can&#x27;t avoid the sun,&quot; Mr Gilbert said.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;Which is not good for people of my skin complexion.&quot;</p><figure class=\"ContentAlignment_marginBottom__4H_6E ContentAlignment_overflowAuto__c1_IL ContentAlignment_outdentDesktop__ijbiK Figure_figure__xLyBy Figure_docImage__DSvk4\" data-print=\"inline-media\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"105922014\" data-uri=\"coremedia://imageproxy/105922014\"><div class=\"Figure_content__8xRH4\"><div class=\"FigureContent_content__GnImC\"><div class=\"ContentImage_ratio__0yYeG\"><div class=\"AspectRatio_container__FC_XH\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:1.5\" data-component=\"AspectRatioContainer\"><img alt=\"A man runs\" class=\"Image_image__5tFYM ContentImage_image__DQ_cq\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"https://live-production.wcms.abc-cdn.net.au/1bbd84b3079baa53b3934d821465072e?impolicy=wcms_crop_resize&amp;cropH=1320&amp;cropW=1980&amp;xPos=0&amp;yPos=0&amp;width=862&amp;height=575\" loading=\"lazy\" data-component=\"Image\" data-lazy=\"true\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"Figure_caption__fS2lN\"><p class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP FigureCaption_text__zDxQ5 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\">Some Karratha residents say a lack of shade is making it harder to cope with hot weather.<!-- --> <cite>(<span>ABC News: Kimberley Putland</span>)</cite></p></figcaption></div></figure><h2 class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP Heading_heading__VGa5B future_heading__Gcudw Heading_default__Z3p_p Typography_sizeMobile20__NUDn4 Typography_sizeDesktop32__LR_G6 Typography_lineHeightMobile24__crkfh Typography_lineHeightDesktop40__BuoRf Typography_marginBottomMobileSmall__6wx7m Typography_marginBottomDesktopSmall__CboX4 Typography_bold__FqafP Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_normalise__u5o1s\" data-component=\"Heading\">Adaptation &#x27;shortfall&#x27;</h2><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Climate scientists have for years been urging communities to adapt to the impacts of climate change by cooling down the built environment.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">But <a class=\"Link_link__kR0xA Link_link__5eL5m ScreenReaderOnly_srLinkHint__OysWz Link_showVisited__C1Fea Link_showFocus__ALyv2\" href=\"/news/2025-09-15/climate-risk-assessment-sea-level-rise-2035-target/105765456\" data-component=\"Link\" data-uri=\"coremedia://article/105765456\">Australia&#x27;s first Climate Risk Assessment</a> found there was &quot;an adaptation action shortfall&quot; across every jurisdiction and geography.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Neither the City of Karratha, nor the other three local governments in the wider Pilbara region, could provide a specific climate adaptation plan when asked by the ABC.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">It was a contrast to other parts of the country, <a class=\"Link_link__kR0xA Link_link__5eL5m ScreenReaderOnly_srLinkHint__OysWz Link_showVisited__C1Fea Link_showFocus__ALyv2\" href=\"/news/2025-09-16/western-sydney-plans-to-address-climate-change-warming/105775030\" data-component=\"Link\" data-uri=\"coremedia://article/105775030\">including in Western Sydney</a>, where a collective of local councils have been working to increase the amount of shade and green-spaces within the city&#x27;s notoriously hot concrete suburbs.</p><figure class=\"ContentAlignment_marginBottom__4H_6E ContentAlignment_overflowAuto__c1_IL ContentAlignment_outdentDesktop__ijbiK Figure_figure__xLyBy Figure_docImage__DSvk4\" data-print=\"inline-media\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"105921920\" data-uri=\"coremedia://imageproxy/105921920\"><div class=\"Figure_content__8xRH4\"><div class=\"FigureContent_content__GnImC\"><div class=\"ContentImage_ratio__0yYeG\"><div class=\"AspectRatio_container__FC_XH\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:1.5\" data-component=\"AspectRatioContainer\"><img alt=\"Greenery over frames next to bitumen parking\" class=\"Image_image__5tFYM ContentImage_image__DQ_cq\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"https://live-production.wcms.abc-cdn.net.au/c7b2256fb3a85a8914d4d9f5a9a08509?impolicy=wcms_crop_resize&amp;cropH=3456&amp;cropW=5184&amp;xPos=0&amp;yPos=0&amp;width=862&amp;height=575\" loading=\"lazy\" data-component=\"Image\" data-lazy=\"true\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"Figure_caption__fS2lN\"><p class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP FigureCaption_text__zDxQ5 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\">Cumberland Council and Western Sydney University are putting together a &quot;cool car park&quot;.<!-- --> <cite>(<span>ABC News: Declan Bowring</span>)</cite></p></figcaption></div></figure><h2 class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP Heading_heading__VGa5B future_heading__Gcudw Heading_default__Z3p_p Typography_sizeMobile20__NUDn4 Typography_sizeDesktop32__LR_G6 Typography_lineHeightMobile24__crkfh Typography_lineHeightDesktop40__BuoRf Typography_marginBottomMobileSmall__6wx7m Typography_marginBottomDesktopSmall__CboX4 Typography_bold__FqafP Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_normalise__u5o1s\" data-component=\"Heading\">Extreme weather complicates adaptation</h2><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">The extremes that define life in northern Australia are making climate adaptation more difficult.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">The most common strategies to reduce urban heat centre on &quot;green&quot; and &quot;blue&quot; spaces.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Plants, trees and water bodies serve as natural &quot;heat sinks&quot;, removing heat from the environment, instead of amplifying it like common building materials such as concrete, steel and glass.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">But both green and blue spaces require lots of water, which in semi-desert regions such as <a class=\"Link_link__kR0xA Link_link__5eL5m ScreenReaderOnly_srLinkHint__OysWz Link_showVisited__C1Fea Link_showFocus__ALyv2\" href=\"/news/2025-09-26/port-hedland-residents-lash-water-corporation-bungle/105812946\" data-component=\"Link\" data-uri=\"coremedia://article/105812946\">the Pilbara, is scarce</a>.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Further north in tropical Darwin, the city&#x27;s tree population is still recovering from a 2018 cyclone.</p><figure class=\"ContentAlignment_marginBottom__4H_6E ContentAlignment_overflowAuto__c1_IL ContentAlignment_outdentDesktop__ijbiK Figure_figure__xLyBy Figure_docImage__DSvk4\" data-print=\"inline-media\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"105922840\" data-uri=\"coremedia://imageproxy/105922840\"><div class=\"Figure_content__8xRH4\"><div class=\"FigureContent_content__GnImC\"><div class=\"ContentImage_ratio__0yYeG\"><div class=\"AspectRatio_container__FC_XH\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:1.5\" data-component=\"AspectRatioContainer\"><img alt=\"Portrait of a man in a purple short-sleeve shirt standing in front of some thin trees.\" class=\"Image_image__5tFYM ContentImage_image__DQ_cq\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"https://live-production.wcms.abc-cdn.net.au/4050b88ae07f4e9221426f627a1d008e?impolicy=wcms_crop_resize&amp;cropH=3072&amp;cropW=4608&amp;xPos=0&amp;yPos=0&amp;width=862&amp;height=575\" loading=\"lazy\" data-component=\"Image\" data-lazy=\"true\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"Figure_caption__fS2lN\"><p class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP FigureCaption_text__zDxQ5 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\">Nick Fewster says the city&#x27;s tree canopy is still recovering from a 2018 cyclone.<!-- --> <cite>(<span>ABC News: Michael Donnelly</span>)</cite></p></figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;We were at around 35, 36 per cent [canopy cover] and it went down to 24 per cent,&quot; City of Darwin Environment Services executive manager Nick Fewster said.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;Our greening strategy [is now] about putting trees in the right places and cooling and greening Darwin.&quot;</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">UNSW architecture professor Matthaios Santamouris urged local governments to focus on climate mitigation strategies tailored to their specific climates.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;I consider that you know evaporation and water misting is not really the best technology for [arid] areas,&quot; Dr Santamouris said.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">In 2019, he published a study simulating different heat mitigation techniques in Alice Springs — an arid climate similar to Karratha.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">It found that strategic shading and using cool reflective building materials were the most effective ways to reduce the city&#x27;s ambient heat.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;We tested these materials on the roof of low-income houses for First Nations people in the area,&quot; he said.</p><div class=\"EmphasisedText_emphasisedText__McMdj ContentAlignment_marginBottom__4H_6E ContentAlignment_overflowAuto__c1_IL\" data-component=\"EmphasisedText\"><blockquote class=\"EmphasisedText_quote__TE6kn\">&quot;<!-- -->The use of these materials decreases the peak temperature indoors by 10 degrees.<!-- -->&quot;</blockquote></div><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Karratha mayor Dan Scott attributed the city&#x27;s lack of shade to historical planning decisions.</p><figure class=\"ContentAlignment_marginBottom__4H_6E ContentAlignment_overflowAuto__c1_IL ContentAlignment_outdentDesktop__ijbiK Figure_figure__xLyBy Figure_docImage__DSvk4\" data-print=\"inline-media\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"105922240\" data-uri=\"coremedia://imageproxy/105922240\"><div class=\"Figure_content__8xRH4\"><div class=\"FigureContent_content__GnImC\"><div class=\"ContentImage_ratio__0yYeG\"><div class=\"AspectRatio_container__FC_XH\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:1.5\" data-component=\"AspectRatioContainer\"><img alt=\"A man with brown hair and blue eyes wearing a dark polo shirt stands in front of a bush with pink flowers.\" class=\"Image_image__5tFYM ContentImage_image__DQ_cq\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"https://live-production.wcms.abc-cdn.net.au/0c2cf3675297529f82a6caf6f7f5f815?impolicy=wcms_crop_resize&amp;cropH=2216&amp;cropW=3324&amp;xPos=306&amp;yPos=0&amp;width=862&amp;height=575\" loading=\"lazy\" data-component=\"Image\" data-lazy=\"true\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"Figure_caption__fS2lN\"><p class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP FigureCaption_text__zDxQ5 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\">Dan Scott says climate change is a threat to the city&#x27;s future growth.<!-- --> <cite>(<span>ABC News: Charlie McLean</span>)</cite></p></figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;We used to design and construct and fund a playground, and then subsequently we&#x27;d go &#x27;oh we might put some shade on there later,&#x27;&quot; Mr Scott said.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;From now on every sort of public infrastructure project that we deliver that is outside, we ensure that it&#x27;s budgeted to include shade.&quot;</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Mr Scott said rising temperatures threatened the city&#x27;s future.</p><figure class=\"ContentAlignment_marginBottom__4H_6E ContentAlignment_overflowAuto__c1_IL ContentAlignment_outdentDesktop__ijbiK Figure_figure__xLyBy Figure_docImage__DSvk4\" data-print=\"inline-media\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"105922302\" data-uri=\"coremedia://imageproxy/105922302\"><div class=\"Figure_content__8xRH4\"><div class=\"FigureContent_content__GnImC\"><div class=\"ContentImage_ratio__0yYeG\"><div class=\"AspectRatio_container__FC_XH\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:1.5\" data-component=\"AspectRatioContainer\"><img alt=\"A man sitting outside at a cafe in Karratha. He&#x27;s sheltering in the shade of a thin tree.\" class=\"Image_image__5tFYM ContentImage_image__DQ_cq\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"https://live-production.wcms.abc-cdn.net.au/b8be6fe277f25c530d13f7353b776c3d?impolicy=wcms_crop_resize&amp;cropH=2216&amp;cropW=3324&amp;xPos=599&amp;yPos=0&amp;width=862&amp;height=575\" loading=\"lazy\" data-component=\"Image\" data-lazy=\"true\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"Figure_caption__fS2lN\"><p class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP FigureCaption_text__zDxQ5 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\">Shade is precious in Karratha.<!-- --> <cite>(<span>ABC News: Charlie McLean</span>)</cite></p></figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;People come up here because there&#x27;s lots of work … but we do have limiting factors like the heat,&quot; he said.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;You need to create that amenity and liveability for people if you want to sustain the growth rate of these regional cities like Karratha, Port Hedland and Darwin.&quot;</p><h2 class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP Heading_heading__VGa5B future_heading__Gcudw Heading_default__Z3p_p Typography_sizeMobile20__NUDn4 Typography_sizeDesktop32__LR_G6 Typography_lineHeightMobile24__crkfh Typography_lineHeightDesktop40__BuoRf Typography_marginBottomMobileSmall__6wx7m Typography_marginBottomDesktopSmall__CboX4 Typography_bold__FqafP Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_normalise__u5o1s\" data-component=\"Heading\">Adaptation tipped to save lives</h2><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Climate projections for northern Australia make for frightening reading.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">The WA government predicts the Pilbara town of Marble Bar will experience 122 days above 40 degrees by 2030, and that is assuming there is &quot;strong global action&quot; to reduce carbon emissions.</p><div>[<figure class=\"ContentAlignment_marginBottom__4H_6E ContentAlignment_overflowAuto__c1_IL ContentAlignment_outdentDesktop__ijbiK Figure_figure__xLyBy Figure_docImage__DSvk4\" data-print=\"inline-media\" data-component=\"Figure\" id=\"105923074\" data-uri=\"coremedia://imageproxy/105923074\"><div class=\"Figure_content__8xRH4\"><div class=\"FigureContent_content__GnImC\"><div class=\"ContentImage_ratio__0yYeG\"><div class=\"AspectRatio_container__FC_XH\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:1.5\" data-component=\"AspectRatioContainer\"><img alt=\"Photo of a digital temperature sign in Marble Bar with a reading of 44 degrees Celsius.\" class=\"Image_image__5tFYM ContentImage_image__DQ_cq\" sizes=\"100vw\" src=\"https://live-production.wcms.abc-cdn.net.au/dc32ccddff471bf3de8a2fcfc9593912?impolicy=wcms_crop_resize&amp;cropH=3376&amp;cropW=5064&amp;xPos=468&amp;yPos=0&amp;width=862&amp;height=575\" loading=\"lazy\" data-component=\"Image\" data-lazy=\"true\"/></div></div></div><figcaption class=\"Figure_caption__fS2lN\"><p class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP FigureCaption_text__zDxQ5 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx\" data-component=\"Typography\">Temperatures commonly exceed 40 degrees in the remote town of Marble Bar.<!-- --> <cite>(<span>ABC News: Charlie McLean</span>)</cite></p></figcaption></div></figure></div><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">Heat-related deaths in Darwin are tipped to rise by 110 per cent by 2050 under a 1.5 degree warming scenario.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;The cost [of rising temperatures] for society is extremely high,&quot; Dr Santamouris said.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;Suicide rates increase very much during periods of high temperatures.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;[And] students when exposed to high temperatures exhibit an important decrease in their cognitive performance.&quot;</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">But Dr Santamouris said the most important heat mitigation strategies were cheap and easily implemented.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;We have the technology to do it, we know how to do it, and we&#x27;ve done it in several parts of the world,&quot; he said.</p><p class=\"paragraph_paragraph__iYReA\">&quot;So we have the potential to improve the quality of life for people immediately, and with very low cost. In my opinion, this is the number one priority.&quot;</p></div><footer><div class=\"ArticleWeb_dateline__RfYd7\" data-component=\"Dateline\"><span class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_letterSpacedSm__V8kil\" data-component=\"Text\">Posted<!-- --> </span><time class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP DynamicTimestamp_displayDate__Y3t35 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_letterSpacedSm__V8kil\" data-component=\"Timestamp\" aria-hidden=\"true\" dateTime=\"2025-10-22T19:59:56.000Z\"><span>Wed 22 Oct 2025 at 7:59pm</span></time><time class=\"ScreenReaderOnly_srOnly__bnJwm\" data-component=\"ScreenReaderOnly\" dateTime=\"2025-10-22T19:59:56.000Z\">Wednesday 22 Oct 2025 at 7:59pm</time><time class=\"Typography_base__sj2RP DynamicTimestamp_printDate__OVPa2 Typography_sizeMobile12__w_FPC Typography_lineHeightMobile20___U7Vr Typography_regular__WeIG6 Typography_colourInherit__dfnUx Typography_letterSpacedSm__V8kil\" data-component=\"Text\"><span>Wed 22 Oct 2025 at 7:59pm</span></time></div><div class=\"ShareUtility_container__Te_u3 A