ies</strong> can help us create an inspiring future for all as we move to a better, cleaner economy.</p><h3><strong>Our Aim: 100% Renewable Energy Eurobodalla by 2030</strong></h3><p>Acknowledgement of Country – <em>SHASA recognises Aboriginal people of the Yuin Nation as the original inhabitants and custodians of all land and water in the Eurobodalla and respects their enduring cultural and spiritual connection to it. SHASA acknowledges the Traditional Owners of the land in which we live and we pay our respect to Elders past, present and emerging.</em></p><p>All donations to SHASA are 100% tax deductible.</p>\";s:16:\"width_percentage\";s:3:\"100\";s:5:\"align\";s:4:\"left\";s:9:\"css_class\";s:0:\"\";}}s:4:\"tabs\";a:1:{i:0;a:1:{s:5:\"title\";s:8:\"Overview\";}}s:8:\"settings\";a:2:{s:7:\"general\";a:7:{s:11:\"description\";s:361:\"<p>As a community led not-for-profit we rely on donations, grants and community support. Your donation helps us roll out local community-focused solutions such as solar energy projects, heatwave and bushfire havens as well as promoting and supporting resilience initiatives across the Shire.</p><p><br></p><p>Donate today or become a member for $5 per year!</p>\";s:20:\"extended_description\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"goal\";s:0:\"\";s:8:\"end_date\";i:0;s:19:\"campaign_creator_id\";s:1:\"1\";s:14:\"form_css_class\";s:0:\"\";s:4:\"tags\";a:0:{}}s:16:\"donation-options\";a:4:{s:16:\"donation_amounts\";a:4:{i:1;a:2:{s:6:\"amount\";d:5;s:11:\"description\";s:25:\"This is a small donation.\";}i:2;a:2:{s:6:\"amount\";d:10;s:11:\"description\";s:35:\"This is a slightly larger donation.\";}i:3;a:2:{s:6:\"amount\";d:15;s:11:\"description\";s:40:\"This is a larger (and default) donation.\";}i:4;a:2:{s:6:\"amount\";d:20;s:11:\"description\";s:25:\"This is a large donation.\";}}s:27:\"suggested_donations_default\";s:1:\"3\";s:23:\"minimum_donation_amount\";s:0:\"\";s:22:\"allow_custom_donations\";s:1:\"1\";}}s:9:\"tab_order\";a:1:{i:0;i:0;}}'),(699,550,'footno