\nThere are plans to extend the outdoor toilet block, which currently only has:  \r\n\r\n- 3 cubicles, including a disabled toilet and shower in the ladies toilet;  \r\n\r\n- 1 cubicle and urinal in the men’s toilet.\r\n\r\n \r\n\r\nThe church is equipped with: \r\n\r\n- satellite and NBN internet  \r\n\r\n- airconditioning with HEPA filters and air purification  \r\n\r\n- backup generators  \r\n\r\n- solar panels  \r\n\r\n- solar battery  \r\n\r\n- water tanks x 2 with fire pumps and hoses. \";s:11:\"author_name\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"author_email\";s:0:\"\";s:5:\"video\";s:0:\"\";}'),(1974,1129,'_oum_location_audio',''),(1977,1153,'footnotes',''),(1979,1157,'footnotes',''),(1981,1162,'footnotes',''),(1983,1165,'footnotes',''),(1984,1166,'footnotes',''),(1985,766,'_wp_page_template','default'),(1986,766,'_wp_old_slug','test-event'),(1987,631,'_wp_page_template','default'),(1988,253,'_wp_page_template','default'),(1989,130,'_wp_page_template','default'),(1990,1173,'is_wp_suggestion',''),(1991,253,'_wp_old_date','2025-11-20'),(1992,1176,'_wp_attached_file','2025/11/SHASA-achievements-2019-2023.pdf'),(1993,1176,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:2:{s:5:\"sizes\";a:4:{s:4:\"full\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:36:\"SHASA-achievements-2019-2023-pdf.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:1497;s:6:\"height\";i:2117;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:595987;}s:6:\"medium\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:44:\"SHASA-achievements-2019-2023-pdf-212x300.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:212;s:6:\"height\";i:300;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:83090;}s:5:\"large\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:45:\"SHASA-achievements-2019-2023-pdf-724x1024.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:724;s:6:\"height\";i:1024;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:220244;}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:5:{s:4:\"file\";s:44:\"SHASA-achievements-2019-2023-pdf-106x150.jpg\";s:5:\"width\";i:106;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:10:\"image/jpeg\";s:8:\"filesize\";i:70594;}}s:8:\"filesize\";i:492744;}'),(1997,646,'_wp_old_date','2025