REPAREDNESS PRESENTATION.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come along and hear guest speaker Kathryn Maxwell, President of SHASA (Southcoast Health &amp; Sustainability Alliance) share inspiring insights into SHASA’s work helping Eurobodalla transition to a low-carbon future, improve disaster preparedness, and strengthen community resilience.<br>Hear more about the development of the eight Bushfire and Heat Havens across the Eurobodalla.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kathryn will be outlining the new Eurobodalla Preparedness Guide which will be posted out to households in the Eurobodalla Shire in mid November.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tricia Pye from The Tec Exec will be discussing digital applications ( apps ) that you need to have installed on your devices for emergencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheTecExec?__tn__=-]K*F\">The Tec Exec</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/shasa.energy?__tn__=-]K*F\">Southcoast Health &amp; Sustainability Alliance</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See less</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','U3A disaster Prepardness Presentation','','publish','open','open','','u3a-disaster-prepardness-presentation','','','2025-10-21 12:57:26','2025-10-21 01:57:26','',0,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?post_type=album&#038;p=645',0,'album','',0),(646,1,'2025-10-04 12:31:43','2025-10-04 02:31:43','Get in the know, get connected, get organised, get packing!\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nGuest speakers:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Kathryn Maxwell - SHASA President</li>\r\n 	<li>Von Hutcheson - Anglicare</li>\r\n</ul>','Tuross Head Community Gardens Disaster Preparedness Presentation','','publish','closed','closed','','tuross-head-community-gardens-disaster-preparedness-presentation','','','2025-11-03 13:40:41','2025-11-03 02:40:41','',0,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?post_type=em_event&#038;p=646',0,'em_event','',0),(647,1,'2025-10-14 12:27:55','2025-10-14 01:27:55','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>SATURDAY 11 OCTOBER 10.30am<br>COME ALONG TO THE U3A DISASTER PREPAREDNESS PRESENTATION.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Come along and hear guest speaker Kathryn Maxwell, President of SHASA (Southcoast Health &amp; Sustainability Alliance) share inspiring insights into SHASA’s work helping Eurobodalla transition to a low-carbon future, improve disaster preparedness, and strengthen community resilience.<br>Hear more about the development of the eight Bushfire and Heat Havens across the Eurobodalla.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kathryn will be outlining the new Eurobodalla Preparedness Guide which will be posted out to households in the Eurobodalla Shire in mid November.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Tricia Pye from The Tec Exec will be discussing digital applications ( apps ) that you need to have installed on your devices for emergencies.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/TheTecExec?__tn__=-]K*F\">The Tec Exec</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/shasa.energy?__tn__=-]K*F\">Southcoast Health &amp; Sustainability Alliance</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>See less</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','U3A disaster Prepardness Presentation','','inherit','closed','closed','','645-revision-v1','','','2025-10-14 12:27:55','2025-10-14 01:27:55','',645,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=647',0,'revision','',0),(648,1,'2025-10-14 12:29:00','2025-10-14 01:29:00','','Screen_Shot_2025-10-01_at_4.58.11_pm','','inherit','open','closed','','screen_shot_2025-10-01_at_4-58-11_pm','','','2025-10-14 12:29:00','2025-10-14 01:29:00','',646,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Screen_Shot_2025-10-01_at_4.58.11_pm.png',0,'attac