>\n<p class=\"has-medium-font-size\">SHASA have recently updated our <a href=\"https://shasa.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/SHASA2030-1124s.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">strategic plan</a> to 2030. It outlines our key areas of focus for the next decade and will be regularly reviewed. All feedback welcomed via our <a href=\"https://shasa.com.au/contact/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">contact page</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','About Us','','inherit','closed','closed','','154-revision-v1','','','2025-10-21 12:09:43','2025-10-21 01:09:43','',154,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=792',0,'revision','',0),(794,1,'2025-10-21 12:15:53','2025-10-21 01:15:53','<!-- wp:create-block/campaignblock {\"campaignID\":\"549\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.gofundme.com/f/tilba-halls-needs-your-help-to-complete-the-massive-rebuild?attribution_id=sl%3A8eaa236d-2bdb-417b-8f91-533016e13ab2&amp;lang=en_AU&amp;ts=1756850158\">Help Tilba Out!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.paypal.com/ncp/payment/6YZN6RGUQGSZC\">Become a Member!</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/?page_id=524\">Public Fund for Tilba</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n